__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Recordings and screenshots: the tests make these, they do not belong here.
tests/media/
tests/shots/

# The program writes its log next to itself, and "next to itself" is
# inside videopodcast_magic/ now. Named by shape rather than by the two
# names that exist today: the run keeps one older log as _1.log, and a
# third name tomorrow would otherwise walk into the repository.
#
# A log holds the file names of whatever was cut with it, so on a real
# machine it holds a real production's -- which is why it may never
# travel.
#
# **This line guards git and nothing else.** The release archive is
# built from the working folder, not from git, so it needs its own
# exclusion -- it has one, in .github/workflows/release.yml and in the
# freigabe skill, and both sides have to keep saying the same thing.
# Whoever removes one of the three because the other two look like
# enough puts a log of somebody's episode on a public release page.
videopodcast-magic*.log

# Working notes from real productions: material for the two of us, not
# part of what is delivered. They stay on the owner's disk.
docs/notes/

# Folders the cleanup script fills. They hold superseded files, not code.
zu_loeschen/
_to_delete/

# Measurement scraps from a real production.
*.wav
*.mov
*.mp4

# Claude Code keeps its local settings here.
.claude/settings.local.json

# What setuptools leaves lying beside the program when a package is
# built out of this folder.
#
# **These three lines guard git and nothing else**, and on 4.9.2026
# that was the whole trouble: a package is not built out of git, and
# setuptools uses `build/` again instead of building afresh. So a
# `build/lib/` from the morning, when the program was still one file,
# put that file and its nine text files into the afternoon's package --
# while `git status` stayed empty and nothing anywhere said a word.
#
# What answers for it is in the freigabe skill: the three are removed
# before the package is built, and afterwards the package is opened and
# held against the folder.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
